repository-code: "https://github.com/ttracx/thox-community-mesh-v04"
abstract: >-
  MeshStack subscribers may opt idle hardware into a private overflow for
  models that do not fit a household. Admission is the v2 planner of record
  (decision D23). The audit log is a permissioned metadata hash chain and is
  not on the token path. No device measurement, price, or production community
  mesh is claimed. Synthetic agents are not authors.
